{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Unveil silky smooth skin with a taste of the tropics. Islander utilizes natural, enzyme-rich Pineapple extract to gently dissolve dead skin cells and rough patches without harsh scrubbing. Balanced by grounding Clary Sage, this tropical bar brightens dullness to reveal a fresh, polished skin surface underneath.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>Islander brings an enzymatic, gentle micro-peel straight to your shower. It blends the natural Alpha-Hydroxy Acids (AHAs) found in fresh Pineapple extract with the grounding, herbaceous, and endocrine-balancing properties of Clary Sage.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Chemical Exfoliation: Natural bromelain enzymes in the pineapple dissolve dead keratin proteins, softening rough elbows, knees, and texturized skin</li>
                    <li>Keratosis Pilaris Relief: Helps smooth down annoying "strawberry legs" or tiny arm bumps by preventing pore buildup</li>
                    <li>Skin Firmness: Clary Sage helps tighten lax skin tissue while promoting a peaceful, steady state of moisture balance</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Rough texture, flaky patches, or dull skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
